{
    "title": "Audacy: Radio & Sports Talk",
    "description": "Listen to music, news, and sports talk, AM & FM radio, and our podcast player, free on the Audacy app.\r\n\r\nYOUR FAVORITE LISTENING IN ONE FREE APP\r\n \r\nSPORTS \u2014 The most sports talk and sports radio anywhere and live play-by-play and game-analysis for many NFL, MLB, NBA and NHL teams.*\r\n \r\nNEWS \u2014 Local news radio plus national coverage from CBS News, Fox News and more.\r\n\r\nMUSIC \u2014 Popular AM & FM radio stations and hosts you know and love, plus on demand radio stations programmed by music lovers.\r\n\r\nPODCASTS \u2014 Free podcast player with access to millions of episodes plus exclusive Audacy Originals.\r\n\r\n\r\nONE PLACE FOR ALL YOUR FAVES\r\n\r\n> Save all the listening you love in My Audio.\r\n\r\n> Access your favorite FM radio stations, local radio stations, sports radio, our podcast player, and NFL content with one tap.\r\n\r\n> Keep clips and episodes for later listening.\r\n\r\n\r\nLIVE & LOCAL MUSIC\r\n\r\nStreaming audio of top FM and AM local radio stations, including V103 (Atlanta), 106.7 KROQ (L.A. and Orange County), 93 XRT (Chicago) and more. On demand stations for every mood, with tracks selected by music lovers, not machines.\r\n\r\n\r\nSPORTS TALK & PLAY-BY-PLAY\r\n\r\nSports talk from FM radio stations and shows nationwide, including WEEI 93.7 FM (Boston) and WFAN Sports Radio 101.9 FM/66AM). Live play-by-play for many NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL and college football teams* plus league-wide coverage from CBS Sports Radio and sports betting tips from BetQL Network.\r\n\r\n\r\nYOUR PODCASTS & AUDACY ORIGINALS\r\n\r\nAll of your favorite podcasts are here, including Dateline NBC, We Can Do Hard Things, Smartless, Search Engine, The Daily,Sports Junkies,  Office Ladies, and more.\r\n\r\n\r\nMORE NEWS & TALK\r\n\r\nFox News and CBS News, plus local news WWJ Newsradio 950 (Detroit), 1010 Wins (NY), NewsRadio 1120 KMOX (St. Louis) and many more.\r\n\r\n\r\nAUDACY EN ESPA\u00d1OL\r\n\r\nYour Spanish-language live music stations and podcasts, as well as Unanimo Deportes, and on demand music stations for artists like Bad Bunny and Shakira.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s audience measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. To learn more about our digital audience measurement products and your choices in regards to them, please visit http://www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information..\r\n\r\n*Play-by-play audio only available within designated market area (DMA) for available teams.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our privacy and data practices visit: www.audacyinc.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Listen to music, news, and sports talk, AM &amp; FM radio, and our podcast player, free on the Audacy app.<br><br>YOUR FAVORITE LISTENING IN ONE FREE APP<br> <br>SPORTS \u2014 The most sports talk and sports radio anywhere and live play-by-play and game-analysis for many NFL, MLB, NBA and NHL teams.*<br> <br>NEWS \u2014 Local news radio plus national coverage from CBS News, Fox News and more.<br><br>MUSIC \u2014 Popular AM &amp; FM radio stations and hosts you know and love, plus on demand radio stations programmed by music lovers.<br><br>PODCASTS \u2014 Free podcast player with access to millions of episodes plus exclusive Audacy Originals.<br><br><br>ONE PLACE FOR ALL YOUR FAVES<br><br>&gt; Save all the listening you love in My Audio.<br><br>&gt; Access your favorite FM radio stations, local radio stations, sports radio, our podcast player, and NFL content with one tap.<br><br>&gt; Keep clips and episodes for later listening.<br><br><br>LIVE &amp; LOCAL MUSIC<br><br>Streaming audio of top FM and AM local radio stations, including V103 (Atlanta), 106.7 KROQ (L.A. and Orange County), 93 XRT (Chicago) and more. On demand stations for every mood, with tracks selected by music lovers, not machines.<br><br><br>SPORTS TALK &amp; PLAY-BY-PLAY<br><br>Sports talk from FM radio stations and shows nationwide, including WEEI 93.7 FM (Boston) and WFAN Sports Radio 101.9 FM/66AM). Live play-by-play for many NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL and college football teams* plus league-wide coverage from CBS Sports Radio and sports betting tips from BetQL Network.<br><br><br>YOUR PODCASTS &amp; AUDACY ORIGINALS<br><br>All of your favorite podcasts are here, including Dateline NBC, We Can Do Hard Things, Smartless, Search Engine, The Daily,Sports Junkies,  Office Ladies, and more.<br><br><br>MORE NEWS &amp; TALK<br><br>Fox News and CBS News, plus local news WWJ Newsradio 950 (Detroit), 1010 Wins (NY), NewsRadio 1120 KMOX (St. Louis) and many more.<br><br><br>AUDACY EN ESPA\u00d1OL<br><br>Your Spanish-language live music stations and podcasts, as well as Unanimo Deportes, and on demand music stations for artists like Bad Bunny and Shakira.<br><br><br>Please note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s audience measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. To learn more about our digital audience measurement products and your choices in regards to them, please visit http://www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information..<br><br>*Play-by-play audio only available within designated market area (DMA) for available teams.<br><br>To learn more about our privacy and data practices visit: www.audacyinc.com/privacy-policy",
